  "body": "## Changelog\n\n- cecace4 Fix #1561 by making the PATH entry replacement regex more expressive (#1562)\n- 1ceb412 chore(deps): bump actions/setup-java from 5 to 6 (#1558)\n- 320cec1 Revert \"fix: install tarballs served through the renaming post-install hook (…\"\n- 8e6ca8f fix: install tarballs served through the renaming post-install hook (#1555)\n- f02e5de fix(list): percent-encode + to %2B in versions query\n- 1c8f4cb chore(deps): bump actions/setup-java from 4 to 5 (#1539)\n- a4f3936 Bump kentaro-m/auto-assign-action from 1.2.5 to 2.0.2 (#1540)\n- f92000f chore(deps): bump actions/checkout from 3 to 7 (#1547)\n- 85dcaa0 fix: pass pr_ci_workflow input to digest caller\n- dec2d95 ci: add Claude Code workflow\n- 22f6e4b feat: add fork-PR triage and dependabot digest callers\n- c2e2ba5 feat: repoint notification callers to renamed reusables\n- b79b2f6 refactor: rename notification stubs to colon-style filenames\n- aa43b20 chore: stagger Dependabot schedule and group minor/patch updates\n\n\n## Contributors\nWe'd like to thank the following people for their contributions:\n- Claude Opus 5 (1M context)\n- Gianluca Costa\n- Marco Vermeulen\n- Pasha Finkelshteyn\n- chloe41427[bot]\n- dependabot[bot]"
